config BR2_PACKAGE_ARDUINO_ZEPHYR_LOADER
	bool "arduino-zephyr-loader"
	help
	  The VENTUNO Q's STM32H5F5 loader from Arduino's Zephyr core
	  (arduino:zephyr), which sketches built with the same core
	  version link against. Installed as
	  /usr/share/ventuno-q/mcu-loader.bin for ventuno-q-mcu.

	  https://github.com/arduino/ArduinoCore-zephyr
